+# T-03 / T-18 系统提示词顺序与根约定
+
+状态：T-03 已完成（2026-11-03）；T-18 补根约定后于 2026-11-06 复验。
+
+## 结论
+
+拼装顺序为 **ROOT → SOUL → AGENTS → MEMORY → USER → NOTES INDEX → skills 索引 → 插件段 → profile → 时间 → 环境**。
+
+- ROOT 是 `agent/system_prompt.py::MEMORY_ROOT_PROMPT`，stable 层第一段，先于 SOUL 与内置身份。
+  七条约定：分层、按需读取、改前先读、`notes/docs/` 只读、保真、工具边界与 `SOUL.md`、
+  自然回复。
+- SOUL → AGENTS → MEMORY 连续，skills 索引不再位于 volatile 首位（T-03）。
+- MEMORY / USER / NOTES 三段连续，中间不插入其它段。
+
+## 验证
+
+```bash
+.venv/Scripts/python.exe -X utf8 scripts/capture_prompt_order.py
+.venv/Scripts/python.exe -X utf8 scripts/run_tests.sh tests/agent/test_system_prompt.py tests/agent/test_system_prompt_root.py
+```
+
+2026-11-06 实跑抓取输出（临时 `HERMES_HOME`）：
+
+```
+ROOT         21  running inside Hermes' local memory system
+SOUL       1978  SOUL_MARKER
+AGENTS     6512  AGENTS_MARKER
+MEMORY     7183  MEMORY (your personal notes)
+USER       7377  USER PROFILE
+NOTES      7502  NOTES INDEX
+SKILLS     7560  - stub-skill:
+PASS every section is present :: all seven
+PASS ROOT comes first :: root at 21, soul at 1978
+PASS SOUL comes before AGENTS
+PASS AGENTS comes before MEMORY
+PASS no skills-index line before MEMORY :: skills at 7560, memory at 7183
+PASS MEMORY -> USER -> NOTES are consecutive
+PASS nothing is injected between MEMORY and NOTES
+PASS SOUL.md really loaded (not the default identity)
+RESULT: all T-03 / T-18 criteria hold
+```
+
+- `tests/agent/test_system_prompt_root.py`：ROOT 先于 SOUL、记忆为空时 ROOT 仍在、
+  MEMORY < USER < NOTES 顺序、stable 前缀两次构建逐字节一致。
+- `tests/agent/test_system_prompt.py`：完整提示词与静态前缀断言已纳入 ROOT。
+
+## 边界
+
+- 抓取脚本用 `sp._skills_prompt` 桩替代真实技能索引，只验证位置，不验证索引内容。
+- ROOT 文本改动会使提示词前缀缓存失效；改动须随会话边界生效，不在会话中途重建。
